    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener>
                    <dateline><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__1079" type="place">Peacham</rs>, <rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__730" type="place">Vermont</rs>, <lb/><date
                            when="1946-08-20">August 20<hi rend="sup">th</hi>,
                        1946</date></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person"
                        >Paul</rs>,</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>About time for an <unclear reason="illegible">¿¿¿</unclear> of yours, isn&apos;t
                    it? <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3964" type="person">Ruth</rs>
                    <unclear>&amp; I</unclear> remember when we celebrated one together with you on
                    the <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__729" type="place">Vineyard</rs>, &amp; so send
                    our congratulations &amp; very best wishes. We are today en route from <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__730" type="place">Vermont</rs> to the family place
                    in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__1080" type="place">Keene Valley</rs>, the
                    Adirondacks. I hope you enjoy a vacation after your summer session labors, &amp;
                    look forward to more seminars together in the fall.</p>
                <closer>
                    <salute>Love to you &amp; <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1923" type="person"
                            >Hannah</rs> from</salute>
                    <signed><hi rend="u"><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__638" type="person">Horace</rs>
                            &amp; <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3964" type="person"
                        >Ruth</rs></hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
